      "description": "The STALLED slice of inference-full (60s window) — the subset of inference pressure where the model was blocked but NOT generating (throughput below the stall floor: 429 back-off / network / TTFT / queueing). Fleet high while inference-full is also high means every active worker is rate-limited at once, NOT generating hard. Main = the dispatcher. opus / sonnet = the same over just the fleet workers on that model, so a single rate-limited model isolates."
